tionIndicator = N\r\nLength &lt;= 12000 where VehicleCategory = N2x, N3x 且 ElongatedCabIndicator = N 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\nLength &lt;= 14000 where VehicleCategory = N2x, N3x  且 ElongatedCabIndicator = Y 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\n\r\n当 LengthAdjustableMin/LengthAdjustableMax 有值时禁止\r\n禁止 where where VehicleCategory = Mx, Nx,  Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）','min=0.0; max=99999.0','5. Length:…mm','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','COC模版_0','2f64ddd3-49aa-5581-a7bc-2895650fe25f',NULL,NULL,'5.',NULL,'{\"COC模版_01\":\"Length:…mm\"}'),(5515,84,'Width','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'C\'\nR2: VALUE &lt;= 2550 IF ALL @MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = \'N\'\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR4: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @LengthAdjustableMin IS PRESENT @LengthAdjustableMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:49:06','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=N2x, N3x, Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 LengthAdjustableMin / LengthAdjustableMax has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\nWidth &lt;= 2550 where VehicleCategory = Mx 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\nWidth &lt;= 2600 where VehicleCategory = Nx, Ox 且 MaximumAuthorisedDimensionsDerogationIndicator = N\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）时禁止\r\n当 LengthAdjustableMin/LengthAdjustableMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0','6. Width:…mm','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','COC模版_0','07686d4d-be9a-5755-b648-f5518f6aeb98',NULL,NULL,'6.',NULL,'{\"COC模版_01\":\"Width:…mm\"}'),(5516,90,'MaximumPermissibleRearOverhang','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [C, V]','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:49:51','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox  且 StageOf Completion = I时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox  且 StageOf Completion = C, V时禁止\r\n当车型=Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'23c17038-3774-553d-8c1d-476338c99aa1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5519,89,'MaximumPermissibleHeight','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [C, V]\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @MaximumPermissibleHeightMin IS PRESENT @MaximumPermissibleHeightMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:51:47','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, N1x, Ox 且 StageOfCompletion =  I时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 StageOfCompletion =  I 且 MaximumPermissibleHeightMin / MaximumPermissibleHeightMax has no value时必填\r\n\r\n当完成阶段= C, V时禁止\r\n当车型= N2x, N3x, Lx时禁止\r\n当 MaximumPermissibleHeightMin / MaximumPermissibleHeightMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'c2745b3a-214d-59cd-b5aa-fd0ed1614746',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5520,85,'MaximumPermissibleWidth','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [C, V]\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @MaximumPermissibleWidthMin IS PRESENT @MaximumPermissibleWidthMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:52:00','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx  且 MaximumPermissibleWidthMin / MaximumPermissibleWidthMax has no value 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车） 时必填\r\n\r\n禁止 where VehicleCode = Lx\r\n当完成阶段=C, V时禁止\r\n当 MaximumPermissibleWidthMin / MaximumPermissibleWidthMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=9999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'d220f40b-7351-5e7a-a223-3cbe309d7da8',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5521,83,'MaximumPermissibleLength','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [C, V]\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @MaximumPermissibleLengthMin IS PRESENT @MaximumPermissibleLengthMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:52:10','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox 且 StageOf Completion = I时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 MaximumPermissibleLengthMin / MaximumPermissibleLengthMax has no value 且 StageOf Completion = I时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Lx时禁止\r\n当完成阶段=C, V时禁止\r\n当 MaximumPermissibleLengthMin / MaximumPermissibleLengthMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=99999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'e0f324ac-9c68-5aeb-af1e-702bfe6be2f5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5522,91,'MassInRunningOrder','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'C\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @MassInRunningOrderVariableMin IS PRESENT @MassInRunningOrderVariableMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:53:14','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 MassInRunningOrderVariableMin / MassInRunningOrderVariableMax has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\n当 MassInRunningOrderVariableMin / MassInRunningOrderVariableMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=999999.0','13. Mass in running order:…kg','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','COC模版_0','16cf9eb4-7187-5b68-a2ff-76052a93e0fd',NULL,NULL,'13.',NULL,'{\"COC模版_01\":\"Mass in running order:…kg\"}'),(5523,92,'ActualMass','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'C\'\nR2: VALUE &lt; @TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMass\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:54:02','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\nValue must be less then TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMass where VehicleCategory = Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx\r\n\r\n当完成阶段=I时禁止\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','min=0.0; max=999999.0','13.2. Actual mass of the vehicle:…kg','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','COC模版_0','51be28d8-51fd-55a1-acb9-824e17cba87c',NULL,NULL,'13.2.',NULL,'{\"COC模版_01\":\"Actual mass of the vehicle:…kg\"}'),(5524,97,'TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMass','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'C\'\nR2: SUM(@AxleGroup, @TechnicallyPermissibleMassAxle) &gt;= VALUE\nR3: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ANY @TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMin IS PRESENT @TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMax IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:55:13','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMin / TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMax has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填\r\n\r\nSum of all TechnicallyPermissibleMassAxle &gt;= TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMass where VehicleCategory = Mx, Nx, Lx, Tx\r\nSum of all TechnicallyPermissibleMassAxle 且 TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumStaticVerticalMassCouplingPoint &gt;= TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMass where VehicleCategory = Ox\r\n\r\n当 TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMin / TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumLadenMassVariableMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=999999.0','16.1. Technically permissible maximum laden mass:…kg','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','COC模版_0','d3988451-1d40-5440-ba40-d7bb606caf08',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5525,95,'MinimumMassCompleted','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1: VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion = \'I\'\nR2: VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @StageOfCompletion IN [C, V]','N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:55:50','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox 且 完成阶段=I（不完整车）时必填\r\n\r\n当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, V时禁止\r\n当车型=Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx时禁止','min=0.0; max=999999.0',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF',NULL,'c664320e-0c98-52f8-9995-340c7f971847',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5526,118,'TechnicallyPermissibleMaximumStaticVerticalMassCouplingPoint','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,NULL,'N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:58:18','',NULL,'Value must exist where VehicleCategory = Ox, Rx, Sx 且 ALL CodeForBodywork  DB 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）','min=0.0; max=999999.0','19. Technically permissible maximum static vertical mass at the coupling point:…kg','NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','COC模版_0','a6625ef2-f132-5832-b631-21a135e07d24',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(5527,268,'GearNumber','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,NULL,'N','0','admin','2026-06-08 18:59:23','',NULL,'当车型=M3x, N3x, Ox, Tx, Cx,